## Differences and action plan

1. Role set post-render (code). A `role="status"` live region added after the element is already in the DOM is often not announced. Fix: set role/aria-label in `connectedCallback` (before first paint) or use host `static` defaults via `ElementInternals.role`/`ariaLabel` (internals), then keep `updated()` for changes. Add a test using an inserted spinner if possible. Alternatively relax the contract wording ("announced when inserted") if browser verification shows it is announced.
2. contract.md Realizations stale (contract). Update Web to built, list parts, coverage and the `--sb-spinner-size` drift. Not a code fix.

No `:host([hidden])` rule (minor; not in contract).

